{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 14, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "伐", "id": "伐"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "名", "id": "名"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "征", "id": "征"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9538153285624265, "source": "勝", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.2347491740244907, "source": "勝", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 2.5416019934645457, "source": "勝", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.9321640810304452, "source": "敵", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.9538153285624265, "source": "敵", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.7455747977904816, "source": "敵", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 0.1212338648141164, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.5266989729222809, "source": "人", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.6253112615903906, "source": "人", "target": "名"}, {"weight": 0.015873349156290163, "source": "人", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 0.23901690047049992, "source": "人", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 3.457892725338701, "source": "上", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 3.457892725338701, "source": "上", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 3.0524276172305362, "source": "上", "target": "征"}, {"weight": 2.2414974010142075, "source": "仁", "target": "愛"}, {"weight": 2.2414974010142075, "source": "仁", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.9538153285624265, "source": "仁", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 1.548350220454262, "source": "仁", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 1.2606681480024813, "so